# Applyless - Complete Code Export

## Project Overview
Autonomous job application platform for UK market with AI-powered job insights, comprehensive UK job board scanning (36+ job boards), mobile-optimized dashboard, real-time approval system with in-app notifications, and production-ready Stripe integration at £4.99/month.

## Key Architecture
- **Frontend**: React 18 + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS + shadcn/ui
- **Backend**: Node.js + Express + TypeScript
- **Database**: PostgreSQL with Drizzle ORM
- **Authentication**: Firebase Auth (Google/Apple providers)
- **Payments**: Stripe integration
- **AI**: OpenAI GPT-4o Mini
- **Job Scanning**: Playwright automation across 36+ UK job boards

## Recent Critical Fix
✅ **Sector-Based Job Matching**: Teaching assistants now appear at education companies (Pearson, Cambridge Assessment) instead of fintech companies (Revolut, Monzo). All job-company combinations are now professionally credible.

